\par\par \b \uc2  Mizoguchi says MOF meeting was not on  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 August 1999\par 06:46\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TOKYO, Aug 3 (Reuters) - Finance Minister Kiichi Miyazawa said he gave various instructions to his key international finance deputies at a meeting on Tuesday, but one of them said they did not discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "I gave them various instructions," Miyazawa told Reuters after the meeting. Asked if he and his deputies discussed \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said he could not comment. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) International Bureau chief Zembei Mizoguchi, asked if the officials had discussed \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in their 30-minute meeting, said they had not. \par \par \uc2  Vice Minister for International Affairs Haruhiko Kuroda declined comment on the meeting. "I can't discuss workplace matters such as what the minister said," he said. \par \par \uc2  Miyazawa, asked if the meeting was routine, did not answer directly but joked that it was unusual for him to be grilled by reporters after meeting with his aides. \par \par \uc2  Earlier on Tuesday, Miyazawa stepped up his rhetoric on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , telling a news conference that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements in the past 20 days, which lifted the yen to 5-month highs against the dollar, were too rapid. \par \par \uc2  He said the dollar's drop on Monday below 114 yen was unfavourable and that he did not think joint market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be difficult. \par \par \uc2  Kuroda, who was originally scheduled to be off on Monday and Tuesday for summer holidays, told reporters he had come in to take care of some paperwork. ((Tokyo newsroom +81-3 3432-8022 tokyo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv8303ef9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
