\par\par \b \uc2  ADR REPORT - Emerging markets highlighs - Aug 27. \b0\par\par\uc2 763 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 August 1998\par 00:34\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  TELEBRAS PLUNGES DEEPER UNDER HUGE SELLING PRESSURE \par \par \uc2     NEW YORK, Aug 27 (Reuters) - Brazilian telecommunications \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Telebras S.A.\tab \tab      plunged to its lowest price in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par nearly two years on Thursday as emerging markets sank to new\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par depths under the weight of Russia's financial crisis.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Telebras, a bellwhether stock for Latin America and one of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the most actively traded in New York, lost more than 10 percent\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of its value as the region's markets came under tremendous\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par selling pressure from hedge funds and other investors.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    "It was a really messy, sloppy market with no end in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sight," said one dealer who specialises in American Depositary\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Receipts (ADRs) from Latin America.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "There was a lot of aggressive hedge fund activity," he\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par said. "There was some volume but a lot of heavy pressure on the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par sell side."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The dealer also said he saw a lot of margin calls being\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par made in New York, as well as local markets throughout the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par region.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Investor flight from the region and other emerging markets\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par showed no abatting amid rising fears that Russia's crisis could\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par lead to a global economic slowdown.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     On Thursday, France, Germany and the United States urged\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the country's new government to act quickly to stabilise the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par battered economy and adhere to free market reform.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     International Monetary Fund officials also held special\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par meetings on the crisis, which has seen the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  suspend\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trading, the stock market close at its lowest\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par recorded level, and opposition groups call for the resignation\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of President Boris Yeltsin.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Anthony Thomas, a Russian economist at Dresdner Kleinwort\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Benson, said it would be only a matter of time before the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  ran out of reserves and started to print money if\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the IMF and the Group of Seven did not provide any more loans\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to the country.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "The outlook for the rouble is very bleak," he said in a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par report sent to Reuters by electronic mail, adding that printing\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par money would usher hyper-inflation and bring about the\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's collapse.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    An investment advisor specialising in Russian equity told\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Reuters that many investors had no choice but to hope for the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par best.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "A lot of people who have invested -- if they didn't get\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par out sooner - are just holding on and hoping that things will\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par eventually improve," he said. "Its hard to see people selling\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at these price because they're so low."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Russian issues such as Vimpel-Communications  were\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par among the leading percentage losers on the New York Stock\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Exchange for a second day in a row.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    In Asia, meanwhile, the Hong Kong government continued to\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the stock market in its battle to fend off\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par speculators.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "It's squeezing out all the shorts," said another trader,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par adding how markets elsewhere in the region were trading in line\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par with the U.S. stocks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.\tab  ended\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par higher in light of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     In the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 United States\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the Dow Jones Industrial Average\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par suffered its biggest point drop since last October.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    The ING Barings Latin American index, which tracks the most\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par actively traded stocks in the region, followed local markets in\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par their downward spiral to end 9.49 points or 8.37 percent at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 103.95, its lowest level this year.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Here are some highlights in emerging ADR trade:\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    * * *\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    BRAZIL - Telebras lost 9 to end at 71-3/4, its lowest point\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par since since December 1996.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    Its umbrella entity   , created to act as an umbrella\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for the holding companies spun off from Telebras, fell 8-7/16\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par to hit 73.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Amaury Bier, the finance ministry's economic policy\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par secretary, denied suggestions that the country would be the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par next to stumble as investors kept withdrawing their money from\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par emerging markets.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * * *.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    RUSSIA - Mobile communications company\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Vimpel-Communications lost 5-8/16 to close at 9-15/16,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par telephone carrier Rostelekom\tab  went down 11/16\par at 3-15/16, and oil firm AO Tatneft\tab  ended\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par off 11/16 at 2-7/8.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Country funds were also hurting, with Templeton Russia Fund\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Inc.    slipping 3-1/16 to land at 8-11/16, and AIM\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Eastern Europe Fund    going 1 lower at 4-9/16.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     * * *.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    MEXICO - Telefonos de Mexico (Telmex)\tab \tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par took off 3-1/16 to end at 34-3/4, while TV Azteca\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    went down 1-1/4 at 5-1/4.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     * * *\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    HONG KONG - Hong Kong Telecom did not do as well in New\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par York as it had in the local market, edging 15/16 lower at\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 18-3/16.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     ((-- Gilles Castonguay, New York newsroom, +212 859 1610)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par 